{"study_accession":"PRJNA505579","secondary_study_accession":"SRP168964","title":"RNA Expression Profile in Patients with Spinocerebellar Ataxia Type 3","description":"lncRNAs play an important role in growth, development, and reproduction, undoubtedly contributing to pathogenesis and progression of diseases. Emerging evidence suggest the involvement of the lncRNAs as a regulatory factors in pathological conditions, including some neurodegenerative diseases.Spinocerebellar Ataxia Type 3/Machado-Joseph Disease (SCA3/MJD) has a prominent prevalence in China. Considering that the role of lncRNAs in the pathogenesis of the SCA3/MJD has not yet been investigated, as a pilot study, we investigated the expression profile of lncRNAs by high-throughput sequencing from 12 patients and 12 healthy individuals. The sequencing results showed 5540 of the known and 2,759 of the novel lncRNAs. 6 lncRNAs were confirmed to be differentially expressed in PBMCs between the SCA3/MJD patients vs. healthy individuals.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":24,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN10426376","study_accession":"PRJNA505579","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"case 1","description":"case 1","sex":"missing","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2019-05-08","attributes":[["strain","not collected"],["isolate","not collected"],["host","not collected"],["isolation_source","Peripheral blood mononuclear cells"],["collection_date","2017-08-15"],["geo_loc_name","China:Hunan Changsha"],["sample_type","cell culture1"],["age","missing"],["biomaterial_provider","missing"],["sex","missing"],["tissue","missing"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR8195663","experiment_accession":"SRX5015055","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"RANDOM PCR","instrument_model":"HiSeq X Ten","read_count":63504097,"base_count":12700819400,"first_public":"2019-05-08","experiment_title":"HiSeq X Ten sequencing: RNA-seq of SCA3"}],"labels":[],"si